	(text "AIN4 / AIN5 read the pressure ports against REFP0 / REFN0 (the 5 V excitation). AIN8-11 serve the precision ports. START and CLK low. DAC outputs 4-7 and AIN6 / AIN7 are not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
